Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:26.28,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}On and on the Great River rolls, racing east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.28,0:01:35.13,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Of proud and gallant heroes,\N its white-waves leave no trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:44.71,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}As right and wrong, glory and fall,\N fade at once into nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.71,0:01:49.44,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yet ever the green hills stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:53.95,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}to blaze in the west-waning day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:06.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The white-haired fishermen and lumberjacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:10.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}on the river banks,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.46,0:02:18.68,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}looking on the autumn moons and spring breezes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:26.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With a jar of wine, they gather on merriment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:30.04,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The countless tales of present and past,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.04,0:02:41.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}all in their jests!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.30,0:02:49.55,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With a jar of wine, they gather on merriment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.55,0:02:52.56,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The countless tales of present and past,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.56,0:03:09.15,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}all in their jests!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:15.08,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,900,3350,4120)\pos(640,481.6)}Act 1\N\N\N\N\N\N\NDeer-hunt of Heroes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:20.74,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1220,3980,5220)\pos(647.609,480.102)}Episode 19 \N\N\N\N\NReunion in an Old City
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister-in-law, please board the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.67,0:04:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:45.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Crossing the Yellow River is crossing into Héběi's borders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:48.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,I will be able to see my elder brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:52.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Who could but reflect in longing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.99,0:05:11.34,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Bidding farewell to Xǔchāng, \Nhanging my seal and locking away the gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:15.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cutting down the warriors of the pass, in order to look for my elder brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:22.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,To see my elder brother's face, I, Guān Yúncháng, would die many times over without regret!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.31,0:05:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng, slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.34,0:05:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng, slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:06:00.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(949.244,497.727)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1720,2080)}Sūn Qián\NStyled: Gōngyòu
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:05:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.83,0:06:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Gōngyòu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.27,0:06:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gōngyòu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.22,0:06:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gōngyòu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Gōngyòu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gōngyòu! Where were you after we were defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.19,0:06:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I wandered around Rǔnán!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.23,0:06:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gōngyòu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.31,0:06:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.99,0:06:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I fled from Xú Province, I wandered Rǔnán.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.59,0:06:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I luckily met {\i1}Liú Pì,{\i0} who gave me shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He sent me to Héběi to ally with Yuán Shào,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.79,0:06:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and invite Xuándé to help defeat Cáo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.18,0:06:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yuán Shào's strategists resent each other and fight for influence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.59,0:06:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuán Shào himself is suspicious and indecisive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.63,0:06:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The Imperial Uncle and I decided to find a way to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.73,0:06:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he has left to Rǔnán.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was afraid you would be harmed by Yuán Shào upon arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.58,0:07:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, I was sent to meet you, to our fortunes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.18,0:07:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān, you can hurry to\NRǔnán to meet with our lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.63,0:07:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The road has been long and arduous, to think it has come to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.39,0:07:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mistresses, is everything alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.79,0:07:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sisters-in-law, don't be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.47,0:07:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Imperial Uncle is in Rǔnán.\NIn a few days, you can meet him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.82,0:08:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you, sir, had not escorted us through the passes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.82,0:08:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the two of us would never see the Imperial Uncle ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.27,0:08:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Guān Yǔ, halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.15,0:08:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop Guan Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.71,0:08:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Sūn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.63,0:08:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard the chariot. I will deal with this myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.07,0:08:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, I will be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.06,0:08:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.26,0:08:57.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(344.269,226.506)}Xiàhóu Dūn\NStyled: Yuánràng
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If you come for me, it would be breaking the Chancellor's promsie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.75,0:09:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The Chancellor did not send out a written word,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.26,0:09:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}yet you trespass \Nand kill our warriors along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This cannot be tolerated!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.42,0:09:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Today, I'm here to capture you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.38,0:09:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Bring you back to the Chancellor in chains!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.75,0:09:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The Chancellor made it clear that going forward, no matter what happens or who dies,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.74,0:09:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I answer to no one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.58,0:09:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yet those gate guards were arbitrary \Nand wanted me stopped despite my reasoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I had to resort to violence in order to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:45.06,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Had it been any other officer, there'd be no quarrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:47.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}But Qín Qí was my subordinate, \Nand my friend Cài Yáng's nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.78,0:09:49.06,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How can I back down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.91,0:09:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you cannot fight with Yúncháng!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.00,0:10:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor admires General Guān's virtue, but he was stopped by the gate guards,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,so he commanded me to relay the order to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Guān Yǔ killed those gate officers to trespass!\NDoes the Chancellor know that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.70,0:10:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, I will arrest Guān Yǔ and take him back to the Chancellor for questioning!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.86,0:10:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not challenge me, knave!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.14,0:10:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, we will decide who is the champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.82,0:10:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.42,0:10:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,General, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.67,0:10:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,General, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.15,0:10:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,General, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But I received the Chancellor's order to arrest Guān Yǔ!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the Chancellor was worried and had me pass along this letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.66,0:10:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He ordered that the passes were not to hinder General Guān!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.40,0:10:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Does the Chancellor know of the killings?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.84,0:10:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.38,0:10:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then if he does not...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, now you have disobeyed the Chancellor's orders multiple times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.63,0:11:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it because I killed Qín Qí?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you are here to resolve this grievance?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And what of it!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.18,0:11:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, I will not hesitate killing\N the Chancellor's trusted officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be thus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.67,0:11:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng, stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.71,0:11:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng, stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng, stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.46,0:11:54.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(974.79,470.454)\fade(255,0,255,0,460,1420,1780)}Zhāng Liáo \NStyled: Wényuǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,By the Chancellor's orders! He heard of Yúncháng's battles, and feared the passes would still halt him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.34,0:11:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,so he sent me throughout \Nthe gate passes to grant him passage!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.91,0:12:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Qín Qí is Cài Yáng's nephew, he entrusted him to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Guān Yǔ killed him, how could I ever rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,General Cài will have to resolve it himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.87,0:12:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but by the Chancellor's generosity, Yúncháng has passage. We cannot disobey that order!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.31,0:12:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday, we shall meet again on the battlefield!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.31,0:12:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng, where are you going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where my elder brother is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.50,0:12:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't know where Xuándé is,\Nwould you like to join the Chancellor again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.15,0:12:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How would that make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.99,0:13:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wényuǎn,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.23,0:13:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Along the way, I committed many misdeeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.52,0:13:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When you go back, please tell the Chancellor I ask for his forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.31,0:13:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.99,0:13:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.66,0:14:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.91,0:14:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave your horses and weapons behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.70,0:14:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you wretches to have the gall to stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.55,0:14:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How amusing! Now leave your horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So, just a bunch of petty horse thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Men, kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.58,0:14:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dismount! Leave your weapons behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:15:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuánshào, stop! \NWe are making a huge mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.91,0:15:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhōu Cāng pays his respects to General Guān!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.03,0:15:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.55,0:15:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This man had reported that there was someone riding a fast steed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.95,0:15:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We stayed over at his family's house and he invited us to steal such a steed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.94,0:15:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We never knew it was yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.35,0:15:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The hero, Guān Yúncháng!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.23,0:15:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We are fortunate to meet with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.86,0:15:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.09,0:15:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We have never met before, how did you know of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.58,0:16:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when General, the Imperial Uncle, \Nand Zhāng Yìdé beat that county inspector at Ānxǐ.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.58,0:16:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The court distributed wanted posters everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since, we have never forgotten your integrity!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have always been eager to see you, and here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.99,0:16:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, you may all stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.67,0:16:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, General Guān!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.98,0:16:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.79,0:16:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have traveled a thousand {\i1}lǐ,{\i0} escorting my\Nsisters-in-law to find my elder brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,all on this horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.35,0:16:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are, having the gall to plot against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.26,0:16:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,For his family's sake, spare his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.82,0:16:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.19,0:16:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.90,0:17:00.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Return to where you belong!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.65,0:17:04.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Do not fool around with petty crime henceforth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.11,0:17:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.10,0:17:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.99,0:17:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.67,0:17:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have long admired your virtue!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.10,0:17:20.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(998.992,452.727)\fade(255,0,255,0,420,1900,2260)}Zhōu Cāng
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.23,0:17:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I am blessed to see you, my life has purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.03,0:17:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to follow you everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lead your carriage and your horse willingly, and I am content with death!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.99,0:17:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.43,0:17:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.27,0:17:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān, please mount your horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.62,0:17:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,"Mount your horse"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.35,0:17:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān, please mount your horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.46,0:18:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān, please mount your horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.91,0:18:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.02,0:18:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, may I ask what is the land behind you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten {\i1}lǐ {\i0}behind me is Gǔchéng.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.47,0:18:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hasten our march! We will rest once we arrive at Gǔchéng!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.43,0:18:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you officials, if I may ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.91,0:18:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there an issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.91,0:19:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A few days ago, a mighty man descended from the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He entered the city, asking for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.11,0:19:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The county magistrate refused. \NThat man got so furious he seized the seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He seized the city and exiled the magistrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.38,0:19:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That man now recruits soldiers and horses and has been storing provisions in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.93,0:19:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He now has three to five thousand soldiers, no one dares to fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, do you know this man's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.75,0:19:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It is Zhāng Fēi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.07,0:19:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhāng Fēi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sisters-in-law!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.03,0:19:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We found Yìdé!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.42,0:19:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.54,0:19:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He is ahead in Gǔchéng!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.55,0:19:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.18,0:20:10.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(978.243,480.896)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.71,0:20:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What weapon you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.98,0:20:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything will do, but preferably something like {\i1}the Green Dragon Crescent Blade,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,just like what General Guān uses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.67,0:20:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm being forgetful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.59,0:20:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday they did remind me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,only sir can refer to General Guān.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.18,0:20:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No one else can talk about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.18,0:20:53.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How could I forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I- Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.51,0:21:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.46,0:21:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Gōngyòu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It is Yìdé! Yìdé!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.99,0:21:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sūn!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.94,0:21:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sūn, any news of my Elder Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.55,0:21:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Of our Imperial Uncle, we can discuss later in detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.91,0:21:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Yúncháng is escorting your\Ntwo sisters-in-law to Gǔchéng!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.38,0:22:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yìdé, are you not happy to welcome him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.32,0:22:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.62,0:22:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me my weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.38,0:22:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yìdé!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.15,0:22:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yìdé?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.79,0:22:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Yìdé coming to welcome us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.83,0:22:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sisters-in-law!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.26,0:22:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sisters-in-law!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.19,0:22:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My third brother is coming to welcome us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.11,0:22:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sisters-in-law! Yìdé is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.58,0:23:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.07,0:23:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.39,0:23:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.91,0:23:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor, face my spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.30,0:23:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.42,0:23:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.55,0:23:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.63,0:23:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Guān Yǔ!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.10,0:23:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you are Guān Yǔ, \Nbut today it is Guān Yǔ who will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.67,0:23:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.30,0:23:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten our Oath in the Peach Garden?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.14,0:23:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no shame! How dare you meet with me face to face?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.11,0:23:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How have I no shame?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.38,0:23:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You betrayed my elder brother, you surrendered to Cáo Cāo,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.50,0:23:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and even accepted a marquis title, \Nand now you've come to deceive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.18,0:23:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll fight to the death!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.23,0:27:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.19,0:24:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother, it's complicated. It's hard to explain right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.91,0:24:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can ask our sisters-in-law here yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.46,0:24:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.88,0:24:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you do this, brother-in-law?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.15,0:24:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there sisters-in-law. I will kill this traitor first.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.55,0:24:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I shall escort you back to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.54,0:24:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Third brother-in-law! He didn't know where you and Imperial Uncle were,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.31,0:24:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,he had to reside at Cáo's camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.14,0:24:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that Imperial Uncle is in Runan,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.47,0:24:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,he escorted us the whole way, past all obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.47,0:24:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't blame him, Third brother-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.14,0:24:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be fooled!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.87,0:24:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A loyal man would rather die than surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.47,0:24:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of man would serve two?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.15,0:24:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.78,0:25:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you accuse me so?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.67,0:25:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yìdé!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.35,0:25:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yìdé!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.62,0:25:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yìdé!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.43,0:25:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yúncháng came back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.31,0:25:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you lie to me too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.87,0:25:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he come for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.63,0:25:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He clearly came to capture me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.39,0:25:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were to capture you, I would bring an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.70,0:25:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that, if not an army?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.99,0:26:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still dare to argue?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.51,0:26:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.43,0:26:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I will show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.63,0:26:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring the drum.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.19,0:27:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Second Brother!\N-Third brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.26,0:27:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.02,0:27:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.06,0:27:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.63,0:27:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My good brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.02,0:27:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed you, my Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.74,0:27:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.87,0:27:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.02,0:27:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.59,0:28:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān is still as strong as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.51,0:28:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No need, no need.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.83,0:28:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.67,0:28:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day, General Zhāng misses the Imperial Uncle and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.90,0:28:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He often wakes up screaming your names.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.67,0:28:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You met today and yet he almost killed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.67,0:28:50.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That is no lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.58,0:28:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Usually General Zhāng doesn't allow us to speak of General Guān.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.62,0:28:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If we do, General will get violently angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.20,0:29:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yìdé is very honest, he detests the evil and the unjust.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.63,0:29:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Admirable!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.92,0:29:10.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(980.168,414.423)}Lady Mí
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.58,0:29:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had gone at each other's throats today, would Second Brother-in-Law still say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.15,0:29:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sisters-in-Law! Second Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.42,0:29:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look who's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.06,0:29:23.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(328.067,490.91)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1720,2080)} Mí Zhú \NStyled: Zi Zhòng
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.43,0:29:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Mi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.75,0:29:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.98,0:29:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Today we've reunited, the only one missing is Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.63,0:29:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I will go look for him in Runan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.71,0:29:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When we came here, we heard my lord, seeing Liu Pì and Gōng Dū were low on manpower,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.82,0:29:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,has gone to negotiate with Yuán Shào.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.46,0:30:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Zhou Cang.\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.47,0:30:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How many serve under Pei Yuanshao?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.47,0:30:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,About four or five hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.70,0:30:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take a shortcut to look for Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.34,0:30:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You go gather some men in Mount Wòniú, and return through the main road.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.62,0:30:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.15,0:30:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This old city is our safe haven. We can't abandon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.71,0:30:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I will look for Elder Brother with Mr. Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.55,0:30:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, you stay here and guard the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.71,0:30:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.15,0:30:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry, brother. \NCome back as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.31,0:31:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there is Hebei.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.43,0:31:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tread lightly, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.98,0:31:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Only take rest for a short while,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.63,0:31:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,wait for me to meet with Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.66,0:31:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongyou, please be quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.58,0:31:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.59,0:32:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.47,0:32:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, if you are so eager to see Yúncháng,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.28,0:32:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,why won't you see Yuán Shào tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.91,0:32:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him you will go to Jīng Province to\Npersuade Liú Biǎo in allying against Cáo Cāo,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.25,0:32:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuán Shào agreed. My lord, you can seize this opportunity to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.63,0:32:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a good plan, but I wonder if\Nyou, Lord Jiǎn, can accompany me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.55,0:32:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, no need to be worried! \NI, Jiǎn Yōng, will find a way to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.30,0:33:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Another long and painful night.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.47,0:33:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Liú Jǐngshēng has the nine commanderies of Jīng Province. We can join together against Cáo Cāo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.27,0:33:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I already sent someone for such a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.98,0:33:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That useless Liú Biǎo refused an alliance!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.31,0:33:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the same family ties.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.63,0:33:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were to be sent, I would have\Nno trouble convincing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.83,0:33:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If Liú Biǎo and I unite together...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.99,0:33:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But he did defeat Liú Pì several times...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.02,0:33:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuándé, you can go negotiate with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.27,0:33:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, I shall go immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.22,0:34:03.58,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(973.565,458.507)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1720,2080)}Yuán Shào\N Styled: Běnchū
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.22,0:34:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard recently that Yúncháng has left Cáo Cāo and intends to come to Héběi.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.43,0:34:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I will kill him, to avenge Yán Liáng and Wén Chǒu!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.27,0:34:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sire once said you wanted Yúncháng by your side, so I sent him a letter. Why do you want to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.98,0:34:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Besides, Yán Liáng and Wén Chǒu are but two deers, while Yúncháng is a tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.82,0:34:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Two deers for a tiger, what is there to hate?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.75,0:34:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm speaking in jest. In reality, I do like Yúncháng.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.79,0:34:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Xuande can call someone to get him here immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.47,0:34:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire, I, Liu Bei shall have \NSun Qian call Yúncháng back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.63,0:34:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Farewell.\N-Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.79,0:35:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Once that man leaves, he'll never return.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.66,0:35:12.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1720,2080)\pos(303.068,454.03)}Guō Tú\NStyled: Gōngzé
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.99,0:35:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.55,0:35:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.90,0:35:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guān, my father asked me to bring water.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.90,0:35:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General, you stood here for too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.90,0:35:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Please put on this robe!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.90,0:35:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,General, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.83,0:35:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him! It's him! It's my elder brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.99,0:35:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.38,0:35:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.34,0:35:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.99,0:36:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Elder Brother\N-Second Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.70,0:36:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Brother\N-My Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.43,0:36:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.67,0:36:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.15,0:36:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, we've been apart far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.86,0:36:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Píng'er, come! Come meet with your uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.26,0:36:28.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(303.068,439.254)}Guān Píng
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.87,0:36:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.34,0:36:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder brother, this is my son {\i1}Guān Píng.{\i0} \NI adopted him in Guanding village.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.47,0:36:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This one greets you, Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.27,0:36:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.95,0:37:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.82,0:37:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.43,0:37:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan! Zhou Cang greets you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.46,0:37:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You were to contact Pei Yuanshao. Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.55,0:37:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,General, before I reached Mount Woniu,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.87,0:37:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a warrior on horseback, he engaged Pei Yuanshao.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.87,0:37:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He killed Pei Yuanshao in an instant, and took over the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.07,0:37:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,When I came to call,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.91,0:37:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,only these few dared to come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.15,0:38:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest were too afraid to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.99,0:38:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I challenged that warrior,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.62,0:38:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but lost to him, injured by his spear three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.26,0:38:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this man? What does he look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.23,0:38:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He is mighty, but I don't know his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.79,0:38:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So, there's someone this powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.66,0:38:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead the way, I will meet with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.47,0:38:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.22,0:38:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out, you brigand! Today will be your last!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.66,0:38:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,General, that's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.39,0:39:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sir {\i1}Zǐlóng?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.71,0:39:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir magister!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.58,0:39:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It is Zilong!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.39,0:39:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir magister!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.67,0:39:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-Zilong!\N-Magister!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.58,0:39:31.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1720,2080)\pos(331.911,454.03)}Zhào Yún\NStyled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.47,0:39:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.34,0:39:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I bid magister farewell,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.34,0:39:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongsun Zan became callous, \Nand brought everyone go down with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.82,0:39:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuán Shào called on me many times,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.26,0:39:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but I refused to serve him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.84,0:39:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Only when I heard you were at Yuán Shào's side
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.02,0:39:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,did I want to come, but I didn't want to meet with Yuán Shào.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.86,0:39:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I was scattered with the wind. \NYet when I was passing by,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.10,0:39:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,that Pei Yuanshao came down to rob my horse, I killed him in self-defense, and took refuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.18,0:40:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I am overjoyed to see the magister again!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.43,0:40:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,To meet again today, it's truly a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.87,0:40:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I had wandered in all directions, looking for a worthy lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.41,0:40:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But none were as worthy as you, magister. To meet again, is truly a great honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.70,0:40:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Through thick and thin,\N I shall follow you to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.22,0:40:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide has come to welcome us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.19,0:40:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Days have been like years! Today, we will reunite!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.46,0:42:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.11,0:42:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.99,0:42:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.79,0:42:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
